 "name": "Test room 6 — more doors",
 "notes": "Milestone 5. A gate for each new door type, left to right. KEY: climb the hurdle, take the key (walk onto it; E hands it to your partner), walk it to the door. FLIP: one of you goes up the stairs, the other drops down the shaft into the lower corridor and walks out of its far end; the lower door shuts behind whoever passes it and in doing so opens the upper door for the other (you cannot climb back out of the shaft alone — but a shoulder carry can). LINKED: stand on the plate to open the first door; the second is its see-saw and opens only after the first has shut (the plate holds it open 2.5s after you step off). ONE-WAY: you can’t go back. SWAP: it starts as Pink’s door; once Pink has passed it becomes Blue’s, and back again. RANDOM: opens and shuts on a seeded timer — wait for it. PORTAL: walk into the ring to cross the pit.",
 "hint": "Door gallery. Key: take it to its door (E hands it over). Flip: split up — the lower door opens the upper one. Linked: plate, then wait for the second door. One-way, swap (Pink first), random (wait), portal (walk into the ring).",
